<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Yeni Parti U\u015fak 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi Yap\u0131ld\u0131","articleSection":"G\u00fcndem","dateCreated":"2026-10-25T15:00:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-25T15:00:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-25T15:00:00+03:00","wordCount":253,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com\/yeni-parti-usak-1-olagan-il-kongresi-yapildi"},"articleBody":"Ge\u00e7en hafta t\u00fcm \u00fcyelerin kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla yap\u0131lan \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7iminin ard\u0131ndan bug\u00fcn de AKM \u2018de delegelerin kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla Yeni Parti U\u015fak 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirildi.\r\n\r\nKongre; sayg\u0131 duru\u015fu ve \u0130stiklal Mar\u015f\u0131 okunmas\u0131yla ba\u015flad\u0131. Divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na Avukat R\u0131za Albay oy birli\u011fi ile se\u00e7ildi.\r\n\r\nAlbay, 600 delege ve 24\u2019\u00fc do\u011fal delege olan hazurun listesine g\u00f6re \u00e7o\u011funlu\u011fun sa\u011fland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirterek kongreyi ba\u015flatt\u0131. Ancak kendisi de salonda az say\u0131da delege ve partili bulunmas\u0131ndan yak\u0131narak a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f konu\u015fmas\u0131 yapmak \u00fczere Yeni Parti Kurucu U\u015fak \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin\u2019i mikrofona davet etti.\r\n\r\nBitgin konu\u015fmas\u0131nda, Yeni parti olarak daim U\u015fak halk\u0131ndan yana bir siyaset izleyeceklerini belirtti ve her t\u00fcrl\u00fc ele\u015ftiriye a\u00e7\u0131k olduklar\u0131n\u0131 ve ele\u015ftirileri dikkate alarak siyaset yapacaklar\u0131n\u0131 dile getirdi.\r\n\r\nY\u00f6netim kurulu faaliyet ve mali raporlar\u0131n okunmas\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan se\u00e7imlere ge\u00e7ildi. Tek liste ile gidilen se\u00e7imlerde Yeni Parti U\u015fak \u0130l Y\u00f6netimi \u015fu isimlerden olu\u015ftu:\r\n\r\nSerap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin (\u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131)\r\n\r\nKamil Can Aksoy, Atilla Alaca, G\u00f6rkem Cankarda\u015f, FahriCaran, Mesut \u00c7al\u0131k, Halil \u00c7elik, Ayd\u0131n \u00c7etinkaya, Serkan Co\u015fkun, Ozan demirci, Ece Durak M\u0131d\u0131k, Ali Ercan, \u015eadi Ercan, Turan G\u00fcnd\u00f6nmez, Nevin \u0130bi\u015f, Dilek Kocab\u0131y\u0131k, Mehmet K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fckak\u0131n, Co\u015fkun Ege O\u011fuzer, Hayrettin \u00d6zdemir,","description":"Yeni Parti U\u015fak 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi tamamland\u0131. Kurucu \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Avukat Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin ve ekibi adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 resmile\u015ftirdi.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yesilsivasligazetesicom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/yesilsivasligazetesi-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/haber-resimler\/tyenipart.png","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Yeni Parti U\u015fak 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi Yap\u0131ld\u0131"},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com\/yayin-ikeleri","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com\/#organization","name":"Ye\u015fil Sivasl\u0131 Gazetesi","image":"https:\/\/yesilsivasligazetesicom.teimg.com\/yesilsivasligazetesi-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/usak-gunluk\/yesil-sivasli-logo-kare.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yesilsivasligazetesicom.teimg.com\/yesilsivasligazetesi-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/usak-gunluk\/yesil-sivasli-logo-kare.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Salih KILIN\u00c7","url":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com\/muhabir\/11\/salih-kilinc"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Seher Zeybek","url":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com\/muhabir\/20\/seher-zeybek"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com\/#organization","name":"Ye\u015fil Sivasl\u0131 Gazetesi","url":"https:\/\/www.yesilsivasligazetesi.com"}}</script>


